{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111370","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111370","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1311137001:1":{"text":"Ludovic, was that the real princess?! Her eyes... She looked like a ghost! Dura above, Chippy is shaking...!","source_cn":"柳博米尔，刚才那个真的是公主殿下吗？她的眼睛……她就像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E69C78B9018CE1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311137002:1":{"text":"Whoever you saw, she is not Yolena.","source_cn":"不管那是谁，都不是亚莲娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF144A3C126175906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1311137002":{"text":"Whoever you saw, she is not Yolena.","source_cn":"不管那是谁，都不是亚莲娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF144A3C126175906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311137003:1":{"text":"Valka...","source_cn":"瓦丽卡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CBAA49E3B5C58D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311137004:1":{"text":"It's nothing. I'm fine... Let's go.","source_cn":"……啊，不，我……我没事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE911455A3C201C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311137005:1":{"text":"You don't look fine...","source_cn":"你可不像没事的样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793337547B5277D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311137006:1":{"text":"We must head to the castle. If my guesses are correct, that's where we will find our answer...","source_cn":"她……我们……我们得去一趟城堡，如果我猜得没错，一切的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF372FBE8747BC5DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311137007:1":{"text":"It could be very dangerous, you should stay here...","source_cn":"那里可能会很危险，你们……留在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925816B20A90A1EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311137008:1":{"text":"Sir Chippy is braver than you think! After all, it's the thrill of danger that makes an adventure truly exciting!","source_cn":"我们才不怕呢！再说了，我们出门就没有不遇到危险的时候！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF32129C00C26196C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311137009:1":{"text":"In that case... here, take this. It's a map of the Valesa Castle. While it may be a bit worn, it should prove useful to you.","source_cn":"既然如此……拿着吧，这是瓦勒沙城堡内部的地图，虽然有些...","status":"matched","ha